    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/psychotherapy/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Psychotherapy is a meticulously designed, free, and clean theme tailored for professionals in mental health services, including therapy clinics, online therapy providers, counseling centers, and licensed therapists. It's perfect for psychologists, psychiatrists, mental health coaches, relationship counselors, and trauma experts who prioritize emotional well-being. Featuring a calm and responsive design that functions seamlessly across all devices, the theme includes essential homepage elements such as a modern slider, dedicated sections for therapy services, a blog, and an easy-to-use contact form for connecting with clients seeking guidance. With SEO optimization, mobile responsiveness, and fast loading times, it enhances online visibility and user experience. Ideal for mental health websites, counseling services, and mindfulness coaching, this theme allows you to share insights, wellness tips, and self-care guides in an engaging layout. Whether you're offering support for conditions like depression, anxiety, or cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT), the theme provides a solid foundation for expanding your client base and establishing trust. Additionally, its integration with the Bookly plugin facilitates online appointment scheduling and automated reminders for clients. It can also include informational sections on broader wellness topics, such as financial planning when relevant for holistic care. Download the Psychotherapy theme today to build a compassionate and professional online presence for your healthcare practice in the wellness industry."
    },
